--- Architecture (mirrors the AuditPanel P4 feature-view disposition) ---
  • Shared-free surface: binds through the `AuditLogSource` seam (P1/S8), so it
    host-compiles without the KMP `Shared` framework and every branch is testable.
  • Adaptive: regular columnar table on macOS/iPad, card list on compact iPhone
    (ADR-002/ADR-006). Design tokens only (Color.TS/Font.TS/TSSpacing/TSRadius, P2).
  • Shared P3 components: TSGlassPanel, TSPanelTitle, TSButton, TSTextField,
    TSSelect, TSDatePickerBridge, TSEmptyState, TSSkeleton, TSAlertBanner.
  • i18n (ADR-014): every literal via AuditLogStrings facade → Localizable.xcstrings.
  • No charts / no map on this surface (web source has none). No SI quantities on
    this surface (timestamps/counts/strings only) — SI converters not applicable.
  • No live/SSE source on this surface (all four feeds are polled REST) — no
    staleness banner required; the load state still carries the ADR-013 stale flag.

